<title>PHILIPPINES: South China 9-mth net 9.195 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>South China 9-mth net 9.195 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South China Petroleum and Exploration Inc said on Wednesday it made a net income of 9.195 million pesos in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>The oil exploration firm said its revenues reached 14.312 million pesos.</p>
<p>The company recently amended its articles of incorporation to include real estate among its secondary businesses. It did not give comparative year-ago figures.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
